OL,3,AWhy hasn't the UK had any named storms
OL,4,Ayet?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith November already on the horizon
OL,7,Fthe UK is yet to see its first named
OL,8,Fstorm of the season.
OL,10,FDeep Atlantic lows responsible for more
OL,11,Fturbulent conditions have been steered
OL,12,Faway by dominant areas of high
OL,13,Fpressure.
OL,15,FThis year the headlines have been about
OL,16,Fworsening drought rather than the
OL,17,Fimpact of gales.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
