OL,3,AWhy hasn't the UK had any named storms
OL,4,Ayet?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, could this be the calm before
OL,7,Fthe storms as the Met Office predict a
OL,8,Fgrowing chance that late autumn and
OL,9,Fearly winter will turn wetter and
OL,10,Fwindier as El Nino strengthens in the
OL,11,FPacific.
